            Team HomeBite
        </h3>

        <p style="
            color:#9ca3af;
            margin-top:8px;">
            Connecting local chefs with hostelers
        </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div style="
        background:#6b2400;
        padding:30px;
        text-align:center;">

        <div style="margin-bottom:15px;">
            <a href="#"
               style="color:#f8d9c7;
                      text-decoration:none;
                      margin:0 12px;
                      font-size:13px;">
               Privacy Policy
            </a>

            <a href="#"
               style="color:#f8d9c7;
                      text-decoration:none;
                      margin:0 12px;
